# Steps 3-4 of #2741: the primitives (build, push, deploy, open, release) and
# their orchestration out of the root package, with what two or more of them
# use in primitive/shared. Declarations the commands still share stay in the
# root package. The file rules come first; the declaration lines after them
# are what those packages pull down. Re-run `go run ./cmd/pkgmove apply -map
# cmd/pkgmove/maps/03-primitive.map -importers ...` after rebasing onto it,
# then move assets/ into primitive/deploy (its embed cannot reach a parent).
rename resolveCurrentDeploySpecs ResolveCurrentDeploySpecsOrchestrated
rename dockerImagePusher PushDockerImageWithRetries
